OL,3,CSavannah Guthrie makes fresh plea for
OL,4,Cmother's safe return
OL,6,FGuthrie posted her video message on
OL,7,FInstagram
OL,9,FAmerican TV host Savannah Guthrie has
OL,10,Fissued a new plea for her mother to be
OL,11,Freturned home nearly six months after
OL,12,Fshe disappeared, telling the alleged
OL,13,Fkidnappers: "Make the right choice."
OL,15,FNancy Guthrie, 84, disappeared from
OL,16,Fher home just outside Tucson, Arizona,
OL,17,Fon February 1, with authorities
OL,18,Fsuspecting she was taken against her
OL,19,Fwill.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
