OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785264513
OL,3,CSavannah Guthrie makes fresh plea for
OL,4,Cmother's safe return
OL,6,F"Our family is in agony. We are in a
OL,7,Fnightmare that will not end, nothing
OL,8,Fabout our situation has changed.
OL,10,F"We have done our part. And we will
OL,11,Fnever stop looking for her. We will
OL,12,Falways ache for her and feel that hole
OL,13,Fin our hearts.
OL,15,F"The world can be a cruel and
OL,16,Funforgiving place, and I know that you
OL,17,Fhave tried to do things the right way.
OL,19,F"So I'm asking you, begging you, to do
OL,20,Fthe right thing now. Make the right
OL,21,Fchoice. Help us find her.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
