PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785264513
OL,3,CSavannah Guthrie makes fresh plea for
OL,4,Cmother's safe return
OL,6,F"Tell us where to look for her. I
OL,7,Ftruly believe it is never too late to
OL,8,Fdo the right thing."
OL,10,FMultiple purported ransom demands have
OL,11,Fbeen made since Nancy disappeared,
OL,12,Fwith three news organisations
OL,13,Freporting receiving such notes and
OL,14,Fturning them over to investigators.
OL,16,FThe FBI discounted some of the ransom
OL,17,Fnotes as extortion attempts, but is
OL,18,Fstill evaluating others that might be
OL,19,Flegitimate, it said.
OL,26,@pD@TO]
