OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785264513
OL,3,CSavannah Guthrie makes fresh plea for
OL,4,Cmother's safe return
OL,6,FSavannah, the host of US breakfast
OL,7,Fprogramme Today, previously offered a
OL,8,F$1 million reward for information
OL,9,Fleading to the recovery of her mother.
OL,11,FVolunteers and search teams scoured
OL,12,Fthe nearby desert terrain filled with
OL,13,Fcactuses, bushes and boulders in the
OL,14,Fweeks after she vanished.
OL,16,FSavannah, who returned to work in
OL,17,FApril, simply captioned her Instagram
OL,18,Fplea: "Bring her home."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
